      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i just re-honed the chisels and it's still happening on certain sections of the board. i've noticed it seems more frequent when the wood feels slightly denser or when the grain turns a bit more aggressively. is there a way to tell if it's a moisture issue or just the natural way certain parts of the walnut react? maybe something about how the wood is seasoned?",
