    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll leave them in the shop for a few more days then. besides moisture and sharpness, is there anything else that could cause such sudden, unpredictable breaks in the wood? like, could there be something internal to the wood itself that i'm not seeing before i start cutting?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
