      "content": "You should check the wood closely for hidden inclusions like knots, mineral streaks, or end-grain stresses, as these all create weak points. Sometimes, even a slight hidden checking or small internal stress point can give way under the fine pressure of chiseling. Before committing to intricate joinery, assess these areas by lightly scoring them to reveal any potential weaknesses.",
